{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "80428f64-ae67-8d73-b88c-b5c5705342ed",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:50:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:48:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hi, this is Sheila Quinn. I got my water bill and it's too high, way too high. They put a new meter last month and now the number, it makes no sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A new meter installed last month, and the bill looks higher than you'd expect. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Double, almost. And I had a plumber come, like two weeks ago, to check the pipes. Nothing is leaking, he said. I kept the receipt, I have it right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, hold on to that. I can put a note on your account and have the meter reading reviewed. They may want a copy of the plumber's receipt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, fine. [pause] Also I want to pay before the weekend, but you close soon, no? How I pay when the office is closed? Online, or a box, something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pay online through the city website, any hour. There's also a payment drop box outside City Hall for checks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, online is good. Sorry, I'm on speaker, I'm in the car. I have to go to my daughter's school, they have an assembly this afternoon and I cannot be late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Can I confirm a callback number for the review?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:49:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0178. Someone will follow up. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:50:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, bye."
    }
  ],
